[Plymouth Theme]
Name=ArkadeOS
Description=ArkadeOS boot screen (T086, round 8): sparks rush in from the dark, the crystal pieces of the Start mark fly in and lock, the gem ignites with a flash, a flare and two hexagonal shock waves, the rays shoot out and the ARKADEOS word comes up; then a light runs round the mark's ticks until the desktop comes. No words of its own, so it reads the same in every language (T010).
ModuleName=script

[script]
ImageDir=/usr/share/plymouth/themes/arkadeos
ScriptFile=/usr/share/plymouth/themes/arkadeos/arkadeos.script
